OL,3,ATrump says he can do business with
OL,4,ABurnham but criticises 'terrible'
OL,5,AChagos deal
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump has said Andy
OL,8,FBurnham is a man he can do business
OL,9,Fwith, after the two leaders met in
OL,10,Fperson for the first time.
OL,12,FTrump said UK-US relations are "more up
OL,13,Fnow" that Burnham is in power,
OL,14,Ffollowing their meeting on the
OL,15,Fsidelines of the UN General Assembly in
OL,16,FNew York.
OL,18,FSpeaking to reporters, Burnham said he
OL,19,Fhad "established a good connection"
OL,20,Fwith Trump and they had "taken that
OL,21,Ffurther today" following discussions on
OL,22,Fissues such as trade and immigration.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
